keywords A Troubled Spirit, Fallen Hero of the Horde, Warrior Kinship, War on the Shadowsworn, Voodoo Feathers, Sunken Temple, Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Blasted Lands, Helboar, Warrior, class quest
