# The level 50-52 Warrior quests: A Troubled Spirit (8417) from any warrior
# trainer of the capitals, then Warrior Kinship, War on the Shadowsworn and
# Voodoo Feathers (8423, 8424, 8425) for the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the
# entrance to the Blasted Lands.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for the chain, objectives,
# drops and places; Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): its change note says Voodoo Feathers no longer
# offers its Classic choice of Diamond Flask, Fury Visor or Razorsteel
# Shoulders, but the same list and Forever's quest page still list three
# choices as unnamed items 20521, 20130 and 20517 (other rewards of that
# patch, such as the Warlock's Trolls of a Feather, are named): unconfirmed,
# so the guide promises experience only.
# INGAME: does Voodoo Feathers (8425) still offer the Diamond Flask, Fury Visor or Razorsteel Shoulders on Forever, or experience only?
# The voodoo feathers
# drop from the Atal'ai minibosses on the Sunken Temple's balcony, which have
# no spawns in the data (Forever's dungeon data,
# "Balcony Minibosses"); the temple entrance, Swamp of Sorrows 69.9,53.6, is
# the one guides/forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater.guide uses.
# No leveling guide takes the chain: Voodoo Feathers needs the Sunken Temple.
# Level 50 and up is above the beta's level cap: this guide is written from
# the data, not from play.
# Counts, levels and fight notes: quest objectives (7 Helboar; 20 Adepts, 10
# Cultists, 20 Thugs; 2 feathers of each colour) and quest-notes (Helboars
# sharing spawns with Felbeasts, the Serpent's Coil camp, the six guardians'
# feathers at 100%, a set per player, the way to the balcony, Hukku's and
# Mijan's spells). Any capital's warrior trainer offers A Troubled Spirit.
# ASSUMED: the six balcony guardians stand and drop as in Classic (Classic flow; Forever's data has no spawns for them). In-game check: the guardians on the Sunken Temple's balcony in front of Jammal'an.

step A Troubled Spirit (Stormwind)
  only Human,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50, Wu Shen, beside Ilsa Corbin in the warrior trainers' building of Old Town, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 5479                        -- Wu Shen

