step The Fallen Hero of the Horde
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The Fallen Hero of the Horde, a ghost, stands in the south-west of the Swamp of Sorrows, at the pass into the Blasted Lands, a short ride south-west of Stonard. Horde: fly to Stonard. Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north through the pass. High-level beasts roam the way.
  turnin 8417                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8423

step Helboars
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Seven Helboars (level 52-53, not elite) roam the north-west of the Blasted Lands, south-west of Nethergarde Keep; some stand near the ogres on the mountainside by the road. They charge from 25 yards and cast Fire Nova. They share spawn points with the Felbeasts and scorpids: if no boars are around, kill those and boars may appear instead. Back in 5 minutes.
  kill 5993 x7 quest 8423.1                   -- Helboar

step War on the Shadowsworn
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  turnin 8423                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8424

step Shadowsworn camps
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The Shadowsworn camp around the mouth of the Serpent's Coil cave, south of Nethergarde Keep on the way to the Dark Portal. You need 20 Adepts (level 52-53, they leech blood and heal hurt allies: kill them first), 10 Cultists (51-52, they throw from range, so close in) and 20 Thugs (52-53, Thrash and Kick). Thugs can run short before the others: kill every Shadowsworn you pass.
  kill 6006 x20 quest 8424.1                  -- Shadowsworn Adept
  kill 6004 x10 quest 8424.2                  -- Shadowsworn Cultist
  kill 6005 x20 quest 8424.3                  -- Shadowsworn Thug

step Voodoo Feathers
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  turnin 8424                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8425

step The Sunken Temple
  tip You need two feathers of each colour from the six Atal'ai troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) on the Sunken Temple's balcony, who hold the barrier in front of Jammal'an the Prophet: Gasher and Zul'Lor drop the amber, Hukku and Mijan the blue, Zolo and Loro the green, every kill; each player on the quest loots their own set. The Sunken Temple is a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. It lies in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows: climb the temple's outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Inside, reach the balcony by the stairs or the path on the right, not the spiral stairs. Hukku calls guardians and casts Shadow Bolt Volley and Curse of Blood; Mijan heals the others (Renew, a Healing Ward, Healing Wave below half health): kill her or her ward fast; Zul'Lor cleaves.
  collect 20606 x2 quest 8425.1 @69.9,53.6    -- Amber Voodoo Feather, from Gasher and Zul'Lor
  collect 20607 x2 quest 8425.2 @69.9,53.6    -- Blue Voodoo Feather, from Hukku and Mijan
  collect 20608 x2 quest 8425.3 @69.9,53.6    -- Green Voodoo Feather, from Zolo and Loro

step Back to the Fallen Hero
  turnin 8425                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  tip In Classic the Fallen Hero let you choose the Diamond Flask, the Fury Visor or the Razorsteel Shoulders here. Forever's change notes say the choice is gone, though its quest page still lists three unnamed rewards: look at the reward window before you hand in.
